{"id":"7be6af6ba052a0dd","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/597_一元道义逻辑.md","title":"597 一元道义逻辑","display":"597_一元道义逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl},\\operatorname{perm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl},\\operatorname{perm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\">\\(OA\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span>。本条目把许可 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 也作为原始一元构造子。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(PA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{597}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{597}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(OA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(PA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(OA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(PA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{597}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{597}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{597}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{597}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{597}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,597}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,597}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{597}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{597}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{597})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{597}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{597}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{597}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{597}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(OA,\\sigma)=O\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(PA,\\sigma)=P\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(OA,\\sigma)=O\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(PA,\\sigma)=P\\operatorname{Sub}_{597}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{597}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{597}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{597}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{597}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{597}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{597}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{597}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{597}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>义务与许可公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{597}=\\{O(A\\to B)\\to(OA\\to OB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{597}=\\{O(A\\to B)\\to(OA\\to OB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{597}=\\{OA\\to PA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{597}=\\{OA\\to PA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{597}=\\{PA\\leftrightarrow\\neg O\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{597}=\\{PA\\leftrightarrow\\neg O\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{597}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{597}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{597}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{597}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597}=\\{((A),OA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597}=\\{((A),OA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{OA}\\ (Nec_O).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{OA}\\ (Nec_O).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{597}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{597}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{597}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{597}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\)</span>；每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{597}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{597}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{597}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{597}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{597}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{597}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{597}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{597}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{597}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{597}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{597}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{597}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{597}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{597}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-许可原始性证书\">8. 许可原始性证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"597\">\\(597\\)</span>-许可原始性证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{Dual}^{597}\n=\\{(A,PA\\leftrightarrow\\neg O\\neg A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{Dual}^{597}\n=\\{(A,PA\\leftrightarrow\\neg O\\neg A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证书的第二分量属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{597}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{597}\\)</span>，并显式连接原始构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 与义务构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目不同于第 596 条，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是原始公式构造子并进入最终系统元组。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MonDeon}_{597}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{597},\\mathsf{Frm}_{597},\\operatorname{PV}_{597},\\operatorname{BV}_{597},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,597},\\mathsf{Subst}_{597},\\operatorname{Sub}_{597},\\mathsf{Ax}_{597},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597},\\mathsf{Rule}_{597},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{597},\\operatorname{last}_{597},\\vdash_{597},\\mathsf{Thm}_{597},\\mathsf{Cert}_{Dual}^{597}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MonDeon}_{597}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{597},\\mathsf{Frm}_{597},\\operatorname{PV}_{597},\\operatorname{BV}_{597},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,597},\\mathsf{Subst}_{597},\\operatorname{Sub}_{597},\\mathsf{Ax}_{597},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{597},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{597},\\mathsf{Rule}_{597},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{597},\\operatorname{last}_{597},\\vdash_{597},\\mathsf{Thm}_{597},\\mathsf{Cert}_{Dual}^{597}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含一元道义逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含二元条件义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-许可原始性证书","text":"8. 许可原始性证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl},\\operatorname{perm}.","display":true},{"tex":"OA","display":false},{"tex":"PA","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{597}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{597}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm